   1               /BETTER SYMBOL TABLE DUMP FOR U/W-FOCAL  -JVZ-
   2               
   3               /THIS PATCH MODIFIES THE 'TYPE $' COMMAND TO PERMIT DUMPS
   4               /WITH MORE THAN ONE ITEM PER LINE. THE NUMBER OF ITEMS MAY
   5               /NOW BE SPECIFIED FOLLOWING THE '$'.  THUS 'TYPE $5' WILL
   6               /DUMP FIVE VARIABLES PER LINE.  THE FORMAT SHOULD BE CHOSEN
   7               /SO THAT ALL ITEMS FIT WITHIN THE WIDTH OF THE PAPER.  THE
   8               /DEFAULT VALUE (IF NONE IS SPECIFIED) IS 3.  THIS PATCH RE-
   9               /MOVES 9 (UNUSED) FUNCTION ENTRY POINTS FROM THE TABLES.
  10               
